            <div xml:id="d714">

                <pb facs="0830" n="712" sameAs="frus:frus1928v02/pg712"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">660f.116Auto/36: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Czechoslovakia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Gittings</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Prague</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-10-13T13:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 13,
                                1928—1 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received October 13—9:45
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>74. Your telegram No. 47, October 11, 5 p.m.<anchor n="54" xml:id="d714-f1"/>
                    Note as amended therein has been presented today. Reference to road tax was left
                    in note. Every effort will be made to achieve results.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gittings</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
